message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "ORASR: Operational Reasoning-Action Safety Routing for Clinical Decision Support"
abstract: >-
  An operational reasoning-action safety routing component that selects safe
  clinical action pathways under uncertainty. It receives a risk and action
  request, checks pathway constraints, selects a route (FAST, NORMAL, or SAFE)
  with a safety override on constraint violation, and records the reasoning and
  audit outputs.
